    <briefdescription>
<para>Canopy eddy diffusivity calculations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module contains routines for calculating eddy diffusivity (Kz) within and just above forest canopies using parameterizations based on Makar et al. (2017) and Raupach (1989). <simplesect kind="author"><para>P. C. Campbell </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>Jun 2022 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
